Z||000000||Zoom88||12-08-2001||11:25 PM|||| I would like to purchase a complete set new round moulding, anyone Know where I can find some? I have looked at the Fiero store but only saw a few different piece, didn't look like I could put together a complete set unless I overlooked something.<P> You will have to excuse me I am having a bad brain day, I know I should have posted this in the Mall<p>[This message has been edited by Zoom88 (edited 12-08-2001).]||||reg||1
